  m_Name: Lionfish
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ObjectName: Lionfish
  Facts:
  - text: "Beautiful but Dangerous!\nThe lionfish is covered in bright stripes and
      long, flowing spines\u2014like a lion\u2019s mane underwater!\nBut don\u2019t
      be fooled\u2014those spines are venomous, and they help scare away predators.\nIt
      hunts with lightning-fast strikes and is known for being a stealthy invader
      in coral reefs.\nLooks like royalty, hunts like a ninja!"
